994 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042 Participated in developing the user interface of a new Sberbank product from scratch\054 later scaled to more than 200\054000 users\056\n\042 Designed the project architecture using FSD\054 improving code readability and maintainability\056\n\042 Developed a reusable table component with filtering\054 drag\055and\055drop columns\054 resizable width\054 infinite loading\054 user notes and a 1\0721 dialog with a manager\056\n\042 Integrated frontend with backend through REST API\073 during design discussions with designers\054 identified technical constraints and proposed alternative UX solutions\054 which helped avoid rework after development started\056\n\042 Adapted the interface for mobile\054 tablet and desktop versions with web accessibility \050a11y\051 support\056\n\042 Optimized application rendering through component memoization\056\nTechnologies\072 React\054 React Native\054 TypeScript\054 JavaScript\054 HTML5\054 CSS\054 Redux\054 Redux Toolkit\054 Sass\054 MobX\054 Zustand\054 FSD\054 REST API\054 CSS\055in\055JS\054 Micro Frontends\054 WebSockets\054 Jest \050unit tests\051\054 SonarQube\054 Web Accessibility\054 Webpack\054 Node\056js\054 Storybook\054 CI\057CD\054 Pixso\054 Jira\054 Confluence\054 Agile\056\n\n\n)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 995 0 R
     /Pg 968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

