998 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042 Developed and maintained the user interface of an online store on React and WooCommerce\054 including product catalog\054 filtering and search\054 product cards\054 shopping cart and checkout process\056\n\042 Created responsive cross\055browser interfaces based on Figma designs for mobile devices\054 tablets and desktops\056\n\042 Increased organic traffic to 50\045 and reduced bounce rate by approximately 35\045 through SEO\054 page\055load speed and UX optimization\056\n\042 Optimized catalog performance and page loading for large product lists and high traffic during advertising campaigns\056\n\042 Integrated frontend with backend through REST API for order placement\054 callback requests\054 city selection and delivery\056\n\042 Developed reusable React components and unified interface styling\054 ensuring a consistent look across all catalog pages\056\nTechnologies\072 React\054 TypeScript\054 JavaScript\054 HTML5\054 CSS\054 Redux\054 Redux Toolkit\054 Sass\054 FSD\054 REST API\054 CSS\055in\055JS\054 Micro Frontends\054 GraphQL\054 WebSockets\054 WooCommerce\054 Jest \050unit tests\051\054 Webpack\054 Node\056js\054 CI\057CD\054 GitLab\054 Figma\054 Jira\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 999 0 R
     /Pg 968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

